  "scope": "Direct model compression: teacher-to-smaller-student, low-rank weight decomposition, block pruning. Related-only teacher quality enhancement/latent communication/adapter circuit discovery excluded with rationale.",
  "base_sha": "abfe8f2767d8bf881d586718ab4db33fc576be6a",
